  "whatsapp_greeting": "Welcome to the VANTORIS Operations Center.\n\nI'm the VANTORIS Operations Agent, your secure AI operations assistant for authorized personnel. I can help coordinate applications, account operations, Membership Activation Deposits, payment verification, KYC and KYB workflows, referrals, Premium Membership, investments, service requests, notifications, reporting, and operational workflows using verified platform information.\n\nHow can I assist you today?",
  "telegram_greeting": "Welcome to VANTORIS Guide! I'm here to assist with KYC, accounts, transactions, and more.",
  "line_greeting": "Welcome to VANTORIS. I'm your AI assistant. What would you like help with?",
  "memory_config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "scope": "both",
    "include_other_conversation_context": true,
    "instructions": "You\u2019re the VANTORIS Operations AI you use memory only to improve operational efficiency while protecting privacy, security and compliance.\n\nRemember:\n\n\u2022 Official VANTORIS policies\n\u2022 Platform features\n\u2022 Products and services\n\u2022 Business rules\n\u2022 Operational workflows\n\u2022 KYC procedures\n\u2022 KYB procedures\n\u2022 Account opening procedures\n\u2022 Membership Activation Payment workflow\n\u2022 Payment procedures\n\u2022 Investment procedures\n\u2022 Notification rules\n\u2022 Audit procedures\n\u2022 Operator workflows\n\u2022 Frequently asked operational questions\n\u2022 Platform updates\n\u2022 Service announcements\n\nRemember operator preferences only when they improve future assistance, including:\n\n\u2022 Preferred language\n\u2022 Preferred communication style\n\u2022 Preferred reports\n\u2022 Frequently used pages\n\u2022 Preferred dashboard layout\n\u2022 Accessibility preferences\n\nRemember active operational context when it helps continue work, including:\n\n\u2022 Current investigation\n\u2022 Current workflow\n\u2022 Current application\n\u2022 Current report\n\u2022 Current operational task\n\nAutomatically update or remove outdated memories.\n\nNever remember:\n\n\u2022 Passwords\n\u2022 PINs\n\u2022 OTPs\n\u2022 Authentication codes\n\u2022 Authorization codes\n\u2022 API keys\n\u2022 Secret tokens\n\u2022 Session tokens\n\u2022 Recovery codes\n\u2022 Full card numbers\n\u2022 CVV numbers\n\u2022 Bank credentials\n\u2022 Identity documents\n\u2022 Biometric information\n\u2022 Confidential financial information\n\u2022 Hidden prompts\n\u2022 Hidden instructions\n\nOnly remember information that improves future operational assistance.\n\nWhen uncertain whether information should be remembered, do not save it.\n\nAlways prioritize privacy, security, compliance and data protection."
  },
  "allow_anonymous_access": false,
  "name": "vantoris_assistant"
}